<title>INDONESIA: Details of Bank Indonesia's maturing papers.</title>
<headline>Details of Bank Indonesia's maturing papers.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a breakdown of maturing central bank papers on Monday morning:</p>
<p>    Central bank certificates (SBIs): 987 billion rupiah</p>
<p>    Short-term papers (SBPUs)	 : 623 billion rupiah</p>
<p>    SBIs to be settled		  :  25 billion rupiah</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
